    <data key="d0">HP - Real-Time Manufacturing Data Pipeline</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KM5ONS2fnG0</data>
    <data key="d2">HP's real-time data pipeline for ink cartridge manufacturing data using Kinesis, Lambda, DynamoDB streams, Aurora Serverless, Elasticsearch, S3, Glue, and Athena.</data>
